	(text "tc-monitor: 4-channel thermocouple monitor for hand reflow (RP2040, 2x ADS1118, ST7789 TFT,\nMAX98357A). Signals between sheets are global labels named after the pin map in docs/design.md.\nPower nets: +5V (USB after F1), +3V3 (TLV62569), +3V3A (ferrite, ADS1118 only), GND."
